ock-533","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/351%20Hoit/","source-block-535","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/352%20Lait/","source-block-526","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/353%20Work/","source-block-525","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/354%20Fjit/","source-block-529","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/355%20PersnikT/","source-block-533","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/356%20Ridiance/","source-block-545","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/357%202024-11-10_Sun/","source-block-546","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/358%2020241116.1/","source-block-546","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/359%20Init/","source-block-541","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/360%20TMF.24.11.18.A/","source-block-546","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/361%20TMF.24.11.18.B/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/362%20TMF.24.11.18.C/","source-block-555","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/363%20TMF.24.11.20.A/","source-block-555","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/364%20TMF.24.11.20.B/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/365%20TMF.24.11.21.A/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/366%20TMF.24.11.21.B/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/367%20TMF.24.11.23.A/","source-block-556","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/368%20TMF.24.11.23.B/","source-block-557","TMF.24.11.23.B",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/369%20TMF.24.11.23.C/","source-block-556","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/369%20TMF.24.11.23.C/","source-block-566","An archived GitP.24.11.23.C.mfpz patch contains this preset name. It shares its stored digital oscillator Type and two oscillator parameter fields with the archived Microfreak/Preset/368 TMF.24.11.23.B and Microfreak/Preset/370 TMF.24.11.23.D patches. Compared with B, the remaining oscillator field, filter cutoff, and resonance differ. Compared with D, a different oscillator field and the filter cutoff differ, while resonance matches. Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/02 Param Controls describes Type and its three shaping controls.",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/370%20TMF.24.11.23.D/","source-block-556","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/370%20TMF.24.11.23.D/","source-block-566","An archived GitP.24.11.23.D.mfpz patch contains this preset name. It shares its stored digital oscillator Type, two oscillator parameter fields, and filter resonance with the archived Microfreak/Preset/369 TMF.24.11.23.C patch; the remaining oscillator field and filter cutoff differ. The saved Type is one setting, while Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/02 Param Controls notes that Type can also be modulated during playback.",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/371%20TMF.24.11.25.A/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/372%20TMF.24.11.25.B/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/373%20TMF.24.11.25.C/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/374%20TMF.24.12.04.A/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/375%20TMF.24.12.04.B/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/376%20TMF.24.12.04.C/","source-block-560","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/377%20TMF.24.12.04.D/","source-block-550","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/378%20Anit/","source-block-535","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/379%20Bnit/","source-block-526","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/380%20Cnit/","source-block-530","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/381%20Dnit/","source-block-527","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/382%20Anit/","source-block-530","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/384%20Bnit/","source-block-530","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/385%20Cnit/","source-block-530","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/386%20Dnit/","source-block-525","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/387%20Enit/","source-block-531","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/388%20Anit1/","source-block-527","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/389%20Bnit2/","source-block-533","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/390%20Cnit2/","source-block-533","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/391%20Dnit2/","source-block-532","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/392%20Blithrifi/","source-block-539","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/393%20answ%20er/","source-block-540","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/394%20Jing%20A/","source-block-539","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/395%2026.06.25/","source-block-536","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/396%20Anit/","source-block-534","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/397%20Imit/","source-block-488","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/397%20Imit/","source-block-498","Used in a recent GitP episode; the episode association is unspecified.",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/397%20Imit/","source-block-576","Saved patch download and export: Microfreak/CLI/Validation/26-10-03 slot 397.",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1044","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1054","Simulates the low-battery chirp of a smoke or fire alarm. Made as a timing cue for GitP/Ceremon/y/Fallveter on 2026-11-14 Sat, following the alarm-cue idea in Making/Music/Log/26/11/11-Wed.",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1259","Sound",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1271","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/02 SuperWave with the waves set to sine.",["Notes","Sound"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1354","Each chirp is the highest G on the keyboard with octave +3, G7, at the minimum sequencer gate length of 10 ms. Attack and decay are at zero.",["Notes","Sound"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1503","The chirps recorded in GitP/A/Session/26/11/14-Sat sound at about 3140 Hz, close to G7's 3136 Hz.",["Notes","Sound"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1609","Sequences",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1625","Set the tempo to 60 BPM for the intervals below.",["Notes","Sequences"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1678","Sequence A chirps once every 60 seconds.",["Notes","Sequences"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1723","Sequence B chirps once every 30 seconds.",["Notes","Sequences"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1768","Low-battery alarms commonly chirp at one of these two intervals.",["Notes","Sequences"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1837","Saved export and provenance",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-1871","Saved export: read from the device's slot 399 over USB on November 12, 2026 with mise run microfreak:download --slot 399. Two consecutive reads returned the same file.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2045","The parameter payload matches no MIDI Control Center factory archive.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2119","Download the slot 399 capture. It is the raw device format (header plus data packets), not an .mbp file; see Microfreak/Preset/399 FireAlarmLoBat/Asset/Device-Read-2026-11-12/bin.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2450","Oscillator",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2467","Model: SuperWave. Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/02 SuperWave",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2634","Wave: 3 (stored choice code). Detune: 0.500. Volume: 0.500.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-2873","Keyboard octave: +3. Glide: 0.000.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-3016","Filter",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-3029","Low-pass filter. Saved cutoff: 1.000; resonance: 0.000. Microfreak/UG/07 Filter/01 Modifying Sound/01 Low Pass Filter",["Notes","Filter"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-3366","Envelopes",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-3382","Main envelope: attack 0.000, decay/release 0.000, sustain 1.000. Amp Mod is on, so the main envelope controls loudness. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/03 Envelope Stages",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-3826","Cycling Envelope mode: Run. Stored RiseLvl 0.163, RiseSlp 0.500, FallLvl 0.163, FallSlp 0.500, Hold 0.000, Amount 1.000. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/06 Cycling Envelope",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-4587","LFO",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-4597","Sine, clock sync on; stored division code: 3. Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/01 LFO Shape · Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/02 LFO Rate",["Notes","LFO"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-4855","Modulation matrix",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-4879","All saved matrix amounts are zero.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-4971","Voice and keyboard",["Notes"]]],"format_version":5}